          "lineage": "Abraliopsis",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "Abraliopsis hoylei is a species of enoploteuthid cephalopod whose type locality is the Mascarene Islands, but this is uncertain, and the type specimen has been damaged, making taxonomic determination difficult.",
